   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progress Toward Outcome: The progress on achieving the outcome is:1. System losses of Nepal reduced to 13% (2018 baseline: 15.3%): NEA has reduced the system loss to 12.73% in 2024.2. Annual per capita electricity consumption in Nepal increased to 700 kWh by December 2026 (2018 baseline: 198 kWh): Annual per capita consumption in 2024 is about 412 kWh.(iii) NEA&apos;s operating costs recovery increased to 100% (2018 baseline: 90%): NEA has reported a net profit in 2024.</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
